msgctxt "7232\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I should go back to Serena with Date-san. I wonder if she'll\n"
"really accept the ring."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7317\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"She must have her reasons for not accepting the ring.\n"
"I better ask her for Date-san's sake."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7409\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"So Mama's husband was murdered. I better tell Date-san about\n"
"this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7476\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Was that guy really Tsukishima, the guy who killed Mama's\n"
"husband? I better follow Date-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7569\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Mama's been abducted by Tsukishima! I better go after\n"
"Date-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7633\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Mama's been abducted by Tsukishima! I better drop these\n"
"thugs quick and go after Date-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7724\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Those punks were a handful. Now to go find Date-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7777\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I'm getting worried about Date-san and Mama. Where did they\n"
"go?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7841\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Date-san's in trouble! I better get to that building in\n"
"Nakamichi Alley fast!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7919\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I better drop these thugs and go save Mama from Tsukishima!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7979\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I hope Date-san and Mama are okay..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8016\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Looks like Date-san got his feelings across to Mama."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8070\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "So that was Mikio's father? Let's see what Mikio has to say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8131\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"These guys are pretty shady. What could they want with\n"
"Mikio's dad?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8199\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Mikio's an adult now. He should be man enough to tell his\n"
"dad how he feels."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8275\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"How are these guys connected to Mikio's dad? I better get\n"
"out of here and see what Aragaki has to say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8378\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I better head back to the Ryudo Family office and tell Mikio\n"
"what's going on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8456\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Something's happened to Nakahara. We have to get to Mikio's\n"
"dad's Okinawan restaurant in front of the station!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8567\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Mikio seems ready to take them on. I better help him out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8625\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Tricky bastard... I better get after that president before I\n"
"lose him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8696\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Now that we got the account books back, we better get back\n"
"to Nakahara and Mikio's dad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8784\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Two fathers, huh? Mikio's got some good people behind him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8844\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Akiho, that girl we just saw at the bikini bar, is\n"
"apparently the sister of Rikiya's old girlfriend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8945\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Looks like Akiho ran into some trouble over by Kyushu No. 1\n"
"Star."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9011\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I guess that girl Akiho has got some customer troubles..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9069\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Sounds like Akiho's in trouble again. I better take Rikiya\n"
"over to the Yoshida Batting Center."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9164\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I guess that girl Akiho has got some customer troubles..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9222\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Akiho's in trouble. I better get Rikiya over to the\n"
"Millennium Tower."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9292\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Something's not right about Akiho... I hope Rikiya knows\n"
"what he's doing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9366\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I don't think this Akiho is telling us the whole story. But\n"
"for now, I guess we better take care of these thugs..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9481\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I think Akiho might just be using Rikiya. Let's see... She\n"
"said she was going back to the club, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9584\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "So it's true. Akiho was lying to Rikiya the whole time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9640\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Rikiya... You just showed me you're a real man. Now it's\n"
"time to hit back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9715\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I better meet up with Rikiya. He should be at the Asia\n"
"bikini bar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9782\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I hope things go well between Rikiya and Natsumi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9833\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I asked Master Utabori to finish up Rikiya's tattoo, but he\n"
"turned us down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9909\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Well, I guess we'll have to teach these punks a lesson."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9965\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Master Utabori decided to finish up Rikiya's tattoo after\n"
"all. I'm glad that's settled."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10054\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Never imagined I'd run into that couple here in Okinawa...\n"
"What're they doing on the beach?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10146\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Well, at least they're gone now... but they said they were\n"
"headed for the Public Market. Hope nothing happens."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10257\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"They're going shopping at Stone Market next, huh? Looks like\n"
"they're having a good time on their Okinawan vacation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10373\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Something's off. They said they were going back to the beach\n"
"by Morning Glory, but I'm a little worried. I should check\n"
"it out later..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10509\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I hope they're not getting into trouble again, but... Koji\n"
"was worried about them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10592\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"They're the same as ever. If that's not a perfect match, I\n"
"don't know what is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10671\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"They're the same as ever. If that's not a perfect match, I\n"
"don't know what is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10751\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Akimoto... How did it end up like this? His boss was worried\n"
"about him..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10825\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Akimoto... How did it end up like this? I should head up to\n"
"the roof of the Millennium Tower."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10919\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"There's something on the roof of the Millennium Tower.\n"
"I should check it out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10997\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"True love can change lives. Looks like they've finally\n"
"communicated their feelings to each other."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11096\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"They were looking for somebody to fill in for their injured\n"
"actor. I wonder if they're still out in front of the theater."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11218\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I'm supposed to beat them in the order written in the script."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11280\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"They want me to perform some flashy techniques now. The\n"
"order of the moves is written in the script for this scene,\n"
"too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11401\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This is the final action scene. I have to make it extra\n"
"dramatic while still staying on script."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11497\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Following the script wasn't easy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11531\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Seems like they got some good scenes on film. I'll bet\n"
"Haruka would be surprised if she saw this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11630\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A man and woman are fighting out on East Shichifuku Street.\n"
"Looks like the woman wants some help..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11730\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I led the lost woman to a bar called Shellac. Should I keep\n"
"her company until the person she's waiting for shows?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11844\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "What's with this guy? He just barged into the room..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11898\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Looks like a complicated scam. Guess I've got to go scold\n"
"some people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11969\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "What was that about? Was she duped or something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12018\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Case closed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12031\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Case closed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12045\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"There was a murder at Café Alps six years ago. I'll ask\n"
"Wakazo to fill me in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12124\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The lead detective on that case might know a lot about what\n"
"happened. I'll look through Wakazo's notebook."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12231\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I should talk to everybody related to the case. The Florist\n"
"might know something, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12318\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I should talk to everybody related to the case."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12366\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Well, I've talked to everybody. Guess I'll go back and see\n"
"Wakazo at Café Alps."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12447\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"It doesn't sound like Kinoshita's wife Yuko is involved in\n"
"the case, but maybe I should look into her anyway."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12557\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I've collected all the information I can right now. I should\n"
"go back and see Detective Maeda."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12651\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I've got all the evidence I need. Tonight, the truth of what\n"
"really happened at Café Alps will be revealed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12760\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The truth about what really happened six years ago has been\n"
"revealed. Looks like Wakazo's passion for journalism has\n"
"found some new life, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12904\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I never thought they'd consider opening up a second Stardust."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12966\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Seems like some of the hosts are really set on getting a\n"
"second Stardust opened up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13050\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Yuya wants to meet me at Bantam. Guess I'll head over there\n"
"sometime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13120\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Yuya said he'd have a talk with Kazuki, but I'm a little\n"
"worried. I'd better go to Stardust later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13219\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Seems like Kazuki and Yuya just couldn't agree."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13267\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Kazuki wants to meet me at Café Alps. He says he's got\n"
"something to talk about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13348\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This is a critical issue for Stardust. They're going to have\n"
"to solve it on their own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13435\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Time to shut this guy down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13463\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Kazuki went over to Kyogoku's office in the Millennium Tower\n"
"on his own. I better get over there immediately!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13573\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"These greedy punks will stop at nothing to get what they want.\n"
"A few busted kneecaps should knock some sense into them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13693\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Seems this whole thing has brought Kazuki and Yuya closer\n"
"together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13762\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A cursed locker, huh...? People say they've heard voices\n"
"coming out of Locker 44 at night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13853\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I definitely hear a voice coming from those lockers. People\n"
"say it's Locker 44. Maybe I should get a closer look..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13969\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"What could be in Locker 44? I guess I'd better take care of\n"
"these punks if I want to find out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14064\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"What were those punks up to? One of them dropped the key to\n"
"Locker 44."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14135\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"So the voice was coming from a cell phone? But what was a\n"
"cell phone doing in that locker?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14226\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"He must be the one these punks answer to. Maybe I can get\n"
"the truth out of him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14306\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Selling modified cell phones, huh? What'll they think up next?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14370\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Seems there's a Devil Cat that brings bad luck. Apparently\n"
"it hangs out around Aqua Sky."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14459\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Seems like this cat wants me to follow it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14504\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This punk is the cat's owner? Seems like he won't listen to\n"
"reason..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14574\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "So that black cat was the Devil Cat?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14611\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Another black cat? I'm pretty sure it's not the same one I\n"
"just saw."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14680\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This cat wants me to follow it, too. Could this be another\n"
"Devil Cat?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14750\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"That old lady needs some water to take her medicine. I better\n"
"get her some fast."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14831\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"So the cat wanted to help the old lady, eh? I guess some\n"
"black cats bring good luck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14917\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I've been hearing talk of a Phantom Tour Guide. Maybe I'll\n"
"find something in front of the station."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15016\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"They said some foreigner in front of the station is running\n"
"tours. Maybe that has something to do with the Phantom Tour\n"
"Guide."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15143\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Sleeping powder and alcohol can knock anybody out. Someone\n"
"needs to teach these thugs a lesson."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15239\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The so-called Phantom Tour Guide turned out to be a group of\n"
"human traffickers. I'm glad the girl is okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15347\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"That same group of high school girls, and now even this kid...\n"
"I guess everybody wants some of that goya juice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15459\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Guess I better buy some goya, kuruzata, basanai, dogwai, and\n"
"lemon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15527\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The mythical goya juice has made its comeback. And that kid\n"
"sure was happy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15604\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "These Coral Love Necklaces seem pretty popular these days..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15665\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Now that I have one of those Coral Love Necklaces, I'll see\n"
"if it brings good luck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15749\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I've been having pretty bad luck. Does this necklace really\n"
"work?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15815\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The company that makes these necklaces is on the second\n"
"floor of the Mishima Towels building, right next to the\n"
"Ryudo Family office."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15948\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I wonder if my luck will improve now I've been exorcised..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16008\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"So that whole necklace thing was a big con after all.\n"
"But I'm sure they'll work honestly from now on after this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16122\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"There's a rumor going around about Golden Agu pork. Maybe I\n"
"can find out more about it at the Public Market."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16231\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"People are asking for Golden Agu pork. This rumor is really\n"
"getting around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16307\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Apparently some company in North Hatsumachi, above the\n"
"Sokinchu soba shop, is selling Golden Agu pork via mail\n"
"order."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16425\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"So this is the company selling Golden Agu pork, huh?\n"
"I better ask some questions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16507\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The whole Golden Agu pork thing is a big sham. What a dirty\n"
"way to do business..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16589\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The company president's been arrested, and the Golden Agu\n"
"mystery is finally solved."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16675\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A man was harassed just for getting close to a car? Sounds\n"
"like somebody's up to no good in Hatsumachi..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16781\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"These are the con men who set that high school girl's dad up?\n"
"Time to show them the error of their ways."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16886\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Now that I signed their agreement, I'll just wait for them\n"
"to contact me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16960\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The way they throw threats around, they've obviously done\n"
"this before. I need to shut down this dirty racket for good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17079\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Those punks must've been the ones who were harassing the\n"
"father of that high school girl, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17174\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I guess now I'm a part of the Seven Mysteries. You never\n"
"know what'll be the talk of the town next..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17277\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Some guy was arguing with the owner of Kyushu No. 1 Star.\n"
"Maybe I should ask about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17364\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"It seems an employee of Acecook is working on a new product.\n"
"I guess it wouldn't hurt to try out his instant ramen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17480\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"That guy is determined to make a better cup of instant ramen.\n"
"I think he went over to the Millennium Tower."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17588\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"That's Ueda from Acecook. Looks like some punks are harassing\n"
"him. I better step in and help him out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17690\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"These punks can't be reasoned with. Guess I gotta send them\n"
"packing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17759\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Ueda from Acecook will probably be dropping by Kyushu No. 1\n"
"Star soon with a new sample of his instant ramen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17869\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"That guy Ueda from Acecook is quite the pro. He refuses to\n"
"compromise on flavor for his instant ramen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17972\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I can't believe that guy Ueda from Acecook came all the way\n"
"down to Okinawa. Maybe I should tell him where the Okinawan\n"
"soba stand is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "18107\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"He sure was pumped on his way to the noodle stand. Maybe I\n"
"should head over there, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "18195\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Seems like Okinawan soba gave him a good idea for his instant\n"
"ramen. He'll probably head straight for Kyushu No. 1 Star\n"
"when it's ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "18332\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"His sample for Kyushu No. 1 Star instant ramen is complete,\n"
"and it's got that famous pork bone flavor. Can't wait for it\n"
"to hit the shelves."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "18474\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I got a map that leads to the Yamashita Treasure. Guess it's\n"
"time to go treasure hunting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "18564\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"An old man out by Ebisu Pawn showed me a map that leads to\n"
"the Yamashita Treasure. I wonder if it's genuine..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "18675\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"So that old man wasn't after the Yamashita Treasure after all?\n"
"But to him, I guess those letters were a kind of treasure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "18798\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This letter seems like a suicide note. I'll ask someone at\n"
"that store in Kariyushi Arcade if they know who bought this\n"
"bottle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "18925\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Apparently, some boy's buying one of these bottles every\n"
"year. I should drop by Ryukyu Shogi to pay him a visit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "19038\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"That boy's the only child in this place, so he must be the\n"
"one. I better go have a chat with him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "19136\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"That boy's running over toward the station. I better go\n"
"after him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "19203\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Turns out no one's in danger of suicide anymore after all.\n"
"I'm glad that woman and her son are doing just fine together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "19325\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"He can't see his mom? What could that be about? Well, I\n"
"guess I'll go after that red balloon for now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "19427\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"There was a boy crying out in front of the lockers saying\n"
"his balloon flew away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "19508\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I lost sight of that red balloon. What could it have to do\n"
"with the kid's mom?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "19587\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The balloon deflated, but the kid got to see his mom anyway.\n"
"I hope they get to spend a nice day together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "19696\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Some old man wants me to take a guy on in the batting center.\n"
"What could that be all about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "19788\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Someone wants to challenge me to a batting contest. I don't\n"
"have time for that right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "19878\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Turns out the guy who challenged me was a pro ball player.\n"
"Whether or not he can make a comeback is up to him, I guess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "19999\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"An old woman asked me for Il Yu-Jin's autograph. This is\n"
"annoying, but I'll just get it over with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "20098\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Damn, I just blew it. Gotta be careful not to touch the\n"
"crazed fans."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "20167\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Damn. Only one chance left... Gotta be careful not to bump\n"
"into these crazed fans."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "20250\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I got Il Yu-Jin's autograph. Now I just have to hand it over\n"
"to that lady."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "20325\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I couldn't get Il Yu-Jin's autograph. That lady's going to\n"
"be disappointed..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "20403\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I managed to get that lady her autograph. I can't believe\n"
"how popular this guy is..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "20489\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Those tourists are looking for a shisa. Guess I'll take a\n"
"walk around town and hunt for one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "20582\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I was able to find that shisa, and the couple is happy, so\n"
"mission accomplished."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "20664\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I was asked to get rid of a stalker. Guess I better start\n"
"looking for him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "20739\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "A woman over by Jewel said she's being stalked."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "20787\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"There don't seem to be any other shady characters around\n"
"here. Maybe Emi was just imagining things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "20887\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"There don't seem to be any other shady characters around\n"
"here. Maybe Emi was just imagining things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "20987\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"So there wasn't any stalker after all. I wonder when that\n"
"guy's going stop clinging to his daughter?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "21089\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"That guy over by Theater Square needs somebody to help him\n"
"collect on a loan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "21167\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I decided to help collect that loan. Now all I have to do is\n"
"find Motoyama somewhere in Kamurocho and make him pay up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "21286\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I decided to help collect that loan. Now all I have to do is\n"
"find Motoyama somewhere in Kamurocho and make him pay up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "21405\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
