msgstr ""

msgctxt "21981\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Damn, this guy's slippery. Two or three good hits should\n"
"bring him down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "22054\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I decided to help collect that loan. Now all I have to do is\n"
"find Motoyama somewhere in Kamurocho and make him pay up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "22173\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Damn, this guy's slippery. Two or three good hits should\n"
"bring him down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "22246\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Motoyama used up all the money. Too bad I didn't catch him\n"
"sooner."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "22313\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I managed to get Motoyama but not without some complications.\n"
"Not sure how much Shibayama could learn from that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "22428\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I managed to get that loan money back from Motoyama before\n"
"he spent any of it. Kind of reminds me of the old days..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "22546\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A strange old man was talking to me. He sure seemed glued to\n"
"my pool game..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "22623\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I was asked to be a stand-in for pool gambling at Aqua Sky.\n"
"Maybe I'll head over there later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "22717\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I won the pool game. That Shiraishi's a pretty decent guy\n"
"after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "22786\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I lost the pool game, but that Shiraishi's a pretty decent\n"
"guy after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "22861\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I've definitely met that woman at Bantam somewhere... But\n"
"where?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "22926\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Looks like Ayaka wants to keep talking. Maybe I should've\n"
"heard her out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "22999\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I wonder how Ayaka's confession worked out. I should stop by\n"
"Bantam."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23068\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Glad to hear it went well for Ayaka. I should stop by Love\n"
"in Heart."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23138\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Taichi wants me to pick up a copy of Shonen Five for him.\n"
"I think they sell it at convenience stores..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23242\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I got a copy of Shonen Five. Just gotta get it to Taichi now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23304\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I gave the Shonen Five magazine to Taichi. He sure was happy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23366\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"What's that guy going to do with that many Shonen Five\n"
"magazines? He went off to a café, apparently..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23470\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"That argument at the café was pretty heated. Maybe I should\n"
"hear what the other party had to say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23569\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I told the editor I'd meet him in front of the OPA building\n"
"downtown. I'll bring this Shonen Five with me just in case..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23691\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I told the editor I'd meet him in front of the OPA building\n"
"downtown. I should bring a copy of Shonen Five with me just\n"
"in case..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23822\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The editor told me to go see Hirano's father. I should be\n"
"able to find him at the pharmacy in the Kariyushi Arcade."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23938\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Hirano's dad headed off towards the Kubochi River. I should\n"
"do the same."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "24011\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Looks like everything's cleared up. Now Hirano can draw as\n"
"much manga as his heart desires."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "24104\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A young businessman was sleeping at Public Park 3. He's\n"
"probably hammered."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "24179\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The troubles a new recruit goes through... Guess I better\n"
"talk to him about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "24259\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I'm worried about that new recruit. He needs to stop wasting\n"
"his life away at the park..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "24349\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This guy's pretty worked up. I need to knock a little sense\n"
"into him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "24419\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"It looks like the new recruit solved his problems. Being the\n"
"new guy is never easy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "24504\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This kid in front of Smile Burger looks like he's worried\n"
"about something..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "24581\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Will that kid be okay after asking her out? Doesn't look\n"
"like he was very reliable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "24665\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"He screwed up asking her on a date... I might've made things\n"
"worse off for him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "24746\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Now that kid's in love with a hostess? He sure moves on fast."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "24808\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Oh yeah, there was that kid in love with a hostess waiting\n"
"outside of Flawless."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "24888\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Looks like that kid got burned. Well, he's a bit young to be\n"
"falling for hostesses."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "24973\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Never imagined that lovelorn kid would show up at Morning\n"
"Glory..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "25040\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"He thinks Haruka and I are an item? What kind of movies is\n"
"this kid watching? Guess I can let him believe it, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "25159\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"It's that kid again? Maybe he'll be able to ask her out this\n"
"time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "25226\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"That kid's no match for those punks. I should lend him a\n"
"fist."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "25289\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "For a kid, he did pretty well. I'll take care of the rest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "25348\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"For a kid, he did pretty well. I hope it all works out for\n"
"them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "25414\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"There's a guy who asks people to hit him for a living.\n"
"Apparently, he's been training pretty hard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "25513\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I got some prize money for hitting Mr. Try and Hit Me. He\n"
"wants me to take him on again sometime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "25612\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"There's this guy who brands himself as Mr. Try and Flee Me.\n"
"Apparently, I can win prize money if I can outrun him.\n"
"Maybe I should give it a shot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "25758\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I can win prize money if I can outrun this Mr. Try and Flee\n"
"Me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "25822\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Looks like I beat Mr. Try and Flee Me at his own game, and\n"
"I got some cash to boot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "25907\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"So now it's Mr. Try and Catch Me, huh? Fine. I'll catch him,\n"
"no problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "25980\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Looks like I beat Mr. Try and Catch Me at his own game, and\n"
"I got some cash to boot. I hope that's the last of these guys."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "26104\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Hide-and-seek? How'd I get myself into this? And I'm \"it,\"\n"
"so I better start looking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "26190\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Taichi and the others seemed pretty bored back at the house.\n"
"They wanted me to play hide-and-seek with them..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "26301\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I found everybody. But how the hell did Taichi manage to get\n"
"up there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "26372\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I made Izumi cry. The idea of ice cream sort of calmed her\n"
"down, but I better be more careful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "26467\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I gave up. I wonder where in the world they were hiding...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "26528\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"There's an old man being harassed by punks near the\n"
"Millennium Tower."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "26598\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The old man was looking for a bar called Jinsei on Suppon\n"
"Street. I'll let him know if I find it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "26696\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Apparently, that bar Jinsei moved to the Champion District.\n"
"Maybe I should check it out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "26785\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I found that Jinsei bar in the Champion District. Better\n"
"report back to the old man in front of Millennium Tower."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "26899\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Another loan shark... Guess I'll have to shut him up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "26953\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"All I did was show him the place. If the old man's happy,\n"
"then no more needs to be said."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27043\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"That lady at Bantam asked me to help her husband. Maybe I\n"
"should ask about it when I've got the time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27145\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Apparently, that lady's husband is wearing red sportswear.\n"
"She said he'd be playing mahjong about now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27248\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A guy in red just left the mahjong parlor. That's got to be\n"
"him. Better not lose him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27334\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Damn. I lost him. Better go back to Bantam and tell his wife\n"
"what happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27410\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This guy's got me all wrong. I'll have to help him cool off\n"
"so we can talk about this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27497\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I wasn't able to help out like I'd hoped, but at least she's\n"
"saying she's going to trust him. Hope they'll be okay..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27615\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Those two seem to understand each other now, so I guess I\n"
"don't have to worry about them."
