msgctxt "27706\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I dropped by Poppo on Showa Street."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27742\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The manager at the Showa Street Poppo said he wants me to\n"
"help him catch shoplifters."
