msgctxt "28839\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I can either tell the fishmonger it's gonna cost 300,000 yen\n"
"or go catch a tuna myself and trade it for the sea bream."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "28958\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I've got 300,000 yen of the fishmonger's money. Now I can\n"
"either go to South Hatsumachi and buy the fish back or bring\n"
"a tuna to trade for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "29101\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I bought back the Ryukyu sea bream for 300,000 yen. Better\n"
"get it back to the fishmonger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "29191\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I traded a tuna for the Ryukyu sea bream. Better take it\n"
