"customers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "29402\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I witnessed a bag-snatching, and I think the criminal ran\n"
"into the Public Market."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "29484\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I witnessed a bag-snatching, and I think the criminal ran\n"
"into the Public Market."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "29566\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Apparently, the old lady's grandson is the bag snatcher.\n"
