msgstr ""

msgctxt "38827\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"What is wrong with that guy? Did he really intend to jump\n"
"into the Kubochi River?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "38910\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"It's that guy in debt again. Why is he so set on jumping\n"
"into the river?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "38983\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"It's that guy in debt again. Why is he so set on jumping\n"
"into the river?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "39057\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Now that I'm caught up in this, I might as well give him a\n"
"hand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "39122\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I think that guy in debt was ready to jump into the river,\n"
