"The cabaret club's business is booming again, but now the\n"
"manager wants me to train a second girl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55566\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I started training a second hostess. I've got to make her\n"
"number one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55636\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The cabaret club's business is booming again, but now the\n"
"manager wants me to train a third girl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55734\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I started training a third hostess. I've got to make her\n"
"number one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55803\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The cabaret club's business is booming again, but now the\n"
"manager wants me to train a fourth girl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55902\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I started training a fourth hostess. I've got to make her\n"
"number one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55972\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The cabaret club's business is booming again, but now the\n"
"manager wants me to train a fifth girl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "56070\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I started training a fifth hostess. I've got to make her\n"
"number one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "56139\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I trained five cabaret girls. That cabaret club should be\n"
"more than fine for a while now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "56230\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I got a call from Reimi. Better head over to Yokoi's office\n"
"on Showa Street."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "56307\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I'll get even with the bastard who betrayed Reimi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "56358\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I had an amazing time with Reimi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "56393\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Rin is being questioned by the cops. Guess I better get over\n"
"to Shine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "56464\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I saw Rin's ex-boyfriend, Masaya. Sounded like he was going\n"
"for a drink over in the Champion District."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "56567\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"So these are the guys who set Rin up, huh? I better smack\n"
"them around so they'll talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "56654\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I had an amazing time with Rin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "56687\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Kana's lost. Says she's in a \"narrow place crammed with a\n"
"lot of stuff.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "56760\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I've got to find Kana's dog Newton."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "56796\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The dog I found wasn't Newton. Guess I better keep looking\n"
"around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "56863\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I heard about a homeless guy playing with a dog. Apparently,\n"
"they're in a vacant lot behind the drugstore, so I better\n"
"check the place out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "57003\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Apparently, Newton's right near a vacant lot behind the\n"
"drugstore. I'll go check it out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "57092\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I had an amazing time with Kana."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "57126\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I got a call from Ranko. Guess I better get to the theater\n"
"fast."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "57191\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I had an amazing time with Ranko."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "57226\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Miyu's son is lost. I better meet up with her in front of\n"
"the lockers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "57297\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Subaru is wearing a white parka. I'll go look for somebody\n"
"on Nakamichi Street who might've seen him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "57399\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I'm taking Subaru back from this idiot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "57439\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I had an amazing time with Miyu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "57473\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Shiori says she's in trouble. She wants me to get over to\n"
"Jewel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "57538\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I saw some guys looking for Shiori in front of Jewel. They\n"
"went over to the theater."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "57623\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I got a call from Shiori. Seems she's at the theater now,\n"
"so I better get over there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "57709\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I saw those guys looking for Shiori again. They went to the\n"
"vacant lot behind the drugstore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "57802\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I'm gonna show these thugs what happens when they mess with\n"
"my girl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "57871\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I had an amazing time with Shiori."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "57907\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I got a call from the host club Adam in the Hotel District.\n"
"Yui is causing a problem at their club."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "58007\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I'll need to pay 300,000 yen in Yui's stead. Once I've got\n"
"it, I should head to Adam in the Hotel District."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "58115\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I had an amazing time with Yui."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "58148\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I got a call from Mika. She's waiting for me in front of the\n"
"monorail station."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "58227\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I have to fight Mika's family bodyguard? How did things end\n"
"up like this?　"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "58304\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I had an amazing time with Mika."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "58338\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I got a call from Nao. Guess I better get right to her\n"
"mother's house in the alley off of Kariyushi Arcade."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "58446\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Crooks who cheat honest people out of their money really\n"
"piss me off. Time teach these punks a little manners."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "58557\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I had an amazing time with Nao."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "58590\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I got a call from Saya. Guess I better get to Karaokekan\n"
"right away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "58659\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I'll make quick work of these idiots."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "58697\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I had an amazing time with Saya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "58731\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Ibuki says that Amon and Minamida are connected somehow.\n"
"I better go talk to Minamida."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "58818\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I have to do something about Amon. Guess I better take a\n"
"taxi to the Mountainside Coliseum come nightfall."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "58925\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Amon's a tough bastard. Just gotta brace myself and fight to\n"
"the end."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "58995\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I managed to beat Amon, so Minamida should be safe now."
msgstr ""